WEBVTT

00:29.980 --> 00:35.320
<i>Reached out and dug my nails in</i>

00:29.980 --> 00:35.320
<i>te ni totte tsume wo tateta</i>

00:35.360 --> 00:38.370
<i>That future</i>

00:35.360 --> 00:38.370
<i>sono mirai wa</i>

00:38.910 --> 00:45.040
<i>Blurred, stained with color</i>

00:38.910 --> 00:45.040
<i>nijimu iro ni kasunde mieta</i>

00:45.080 --> 00:51.050
<i>A red that blotted out even summer's light</i>

00:45.080 --> 00:51.050
<i>natsu no iro mo nuritsubusu youna aka ni</i>

00:51.880 --> 00:58.300
<i>As if our voices were drowned out</i>

00:51.880 --> 00:58.300
<i>bokura no koe kakikesareteiku you de</i>

00:58.350 --> 01:05.060
<i>Let your frozen feet break free</i>

00:58.350 --> 01:05.060
<i>tachidomaru sono ashi wo fumidasou ze</i>

01:05.100 --> 01:11.360
<i>Better than slipping past the pretty lies</i>

01:05.100 --> 01:11.360
<i>misekake no uso yarisugosu yori</i>

01:11.820 --> 01:14.820
<i>These countless mornings</i>

01:11.820 --> 01:14.820
<i>nandome no asa</i>

01:14.860 --> 01:17.910
<i>We trade our sacred dreams</i>

01:14.860 --> 01:17.910
<i>chikai to hikikaeru yo</i>

01:17.950 --> 01:24.870
<i>In exchange for a vow</i>

01:17.950 --> 01:24.870
<i>bokura ga miteita yume</i>

01:43.060 --> 01:45.930
It's another pefect day for eating carrots!

01:47.980 --> 01:51.900
I can't believe there is such a comfy island
outside of Zou.

01:51.940 --> 01:55.240
The sea sure is a wonderland!

01:56.740 --> 01:58.240
W-What happened?!

02:03.040 --> 02:04.950
What... What?

02:05.000 --> 02:07.120
What?!

02:09.420 --> 02:11.040
A giant shadow?

02:11.170 --> 02:16.380
That's right! A huge shadow
passed over my head!

02:16.420 --> 02:22.510
I couldn't help but drop my snack carrot
and run away.

02:24.890 --> 02:28.520
Oh yeah, after we left Alabasta...

02:33.110 --> 02:36.400
Monsters!

02:37.280 --> 02:38.860
No way.

02:38.900 --> 02:44.580
But the only other beings I can think of
are the Giants...

02:44.700 --> 02:46.750
Giants?

02:46.790 --> 02:48.250
That's it!

02:48.290 --> 02:49.620
Hey, Chobro.

02:49.660 --> 02:54.800
Let's find out who the Giant was together!

02:55.340 --> 02:59.010
I'm starting to get curious
about who that was myself...

03:01.840 --> 03:04.640
Even the Video Transponder Snail
seems motivated.

03:04.680 --> 03:08.180
All right, then let's review
what we know about the Giants!

03:08.310 --> 03:09.640
Yay!

03:09.770 --> 03:13.270
Join us, everyone! Okay, ready?!

03:14.480 --> 03:22.280
<i>"Dr. Chopper's Adventure Checkup
-The Proud Dream of the Giants-"</i>

03:27.830 --> 03:30.080
<i>Suddenly, a dinosaur?!</i>

03:30.540 --> 03:33.330
<i>Chobro, what island is this?!</i>

03:33.960 --> 03:38.510
<i>This is Luffy and the others' adventure
before I met them!</i>

03:38.630 --> 03:40.760
<i>What?!</i>

03:42.010 --> 03:43.220
A dinosaur?!

03:43.340 --> 03:44.470
A dinosaur?!

03:45.140 --> 03:46.260
<i>Vivi?!</i>

03:47.640 --> 03:50.270
<i>Oh yeah, Usopp once told me about it.</i>

03:50.640 --> 03:53.850
<i>This is Little Garden, the Island of Giants!</i>

03:53.980 --> 03:56.060
<i>Little Garden!</i>

04:15.080 --> 04:19.500
I'm Dorry,
the strongest warrior of Elbaph!

04:19.630 --> 04:25.510
DORRY THE BLUE OGRE
CAPTAIN OF THE GIANT PIRATE CREW

04:20.880 --> 04:23.010
<i>The captain of the Giant Pirate Crew.</i>

04:23.050 --> 04:24.890
<i>Dorry the Blue Ogre.</i>

04:26.850 --> 04:29.470
I said, "Do you have any booze?"

04:44.450 --> 04:49.910
I'm Brogy,
the strongest warrior of Elbaph!

04:50.540 --> 04:56.420
BROGY THE RED OGRE
CAPTAIN OF THE GIANT PIRATE CREW

04:51.540 --> 04:53.710
<i>The captain of the Giant Pirate Crew.</i>

04:53.750 --> 04:55.710
<i>Brogy the Red Ogre.</i>

04:58.540 --> 05:02.760
<i>They both called themselves
the strongest warrior of Elbaph.</i>

05:02.800 --> 05:04.880
<i>Maybe they're good friends.</i>

05:05.010 --> 05:06.010
<i>No...</i>

05:06.590 --> 05:10.680
<i>Adhering to the code of
the Giants' island, Elbaph,</i>

05:10.720 --> 05:13.390
<i>to settle a dispute they had,</i>

05:13.430 --> 05:19.150
<i>they had been fighting a duel
on this island for a century.</i>

05:19.270 --> 05:21.070
<i>For a century?!</i>

05:21.110 --> 05:23.990
<i>I can't believe there is such a duel...</i>

05:24.030 --> 05:26.740
<i>The sea is a wonderland!</i>

05:30.910 --> 05:32.700
I've got to go.

05:32.830 --> 05:36.580
The eruption of Dead Center Mountain
is the signal for battle.

05:36.710 --> 05:39.580
What was the dispute about?!

05:39.710 --> 05:41.630
Yeah, this is a matter of honor.

05:47.510 --> 05:50.350
The reason why we fight...

05:52.260 --> 05:54.890
...is long-forgotten!

05:55.520 --> 05:56.770
Don't you get it?!

05:56.810 --> 06:01.020
This is a duel fueled by
the pride of two true warriors!

06:03.070 --> 06:08.150
This is exactly what I want to become!
A Brave Warrior of the Sea!

06:09.070 --> 06:12.740
I want to be a man with pride,
just like them!

06:13.830 --> 06:16.160
If there is a whole village of
warriors like them,

06:16.910 --> 06:19.370
I wanna go there someday!

06:21.250 --> 06:24.750
<i>But something interrupted their battle.</i>

06:28.720 --> 06:30.010
<i>How terrible...</i>

06:30.050 --> 06:34.760
<i>A century-long duel
should not end like this!</i>

06:35.520 --> 06:36.890
Old Giant man!

06:47.860 --> 06:49.650
A century...

06:53.580 --> 06:57.080
It was a long battle!

07:15.760 --> 07:20.850
<i>If this is our end, Elbaph,</i>

07:21.650 --> 07:24.020
<i>it's too cruel!</i>

07:24.060 --> 07:27.320
<i>Why won't you let us die in battle?!</i>

07:27.780 --> 07:29.150
You can still move, right?

07:29.280 --> 07:32.490
--What?
--I can still move, too.

07:34.240 --> 07:37.040
Do you wanna crush them with me?

07:37.160 --> 07:40.460
I'll go along with that spirit!

07:43.290 --> 07:45.420
Flaming Oni...

07:48.420 --> 07:49.840
...giri!

08:05.980 --> 08:07.980
Hey, it's good to be alive.

08:09.360 --> 08:10.440
Yeah.

08:15.030 --> 08:17.450
<i>And when my friends
were leaving for the next island...</i>

08:17.580 --> 08:19.540
They came to see us off.

08:19.660 --> 08:24.210
You people risked your lives
to defend our honor.

08:24.330 --> 08:27.460
So no matter who we're up against...

08:27.590 --> 08:30.460
We won't let them tarnish our friends' pride.

08:32.260 --> 08:35.390
Believe us and sail straight ahead!

08:35.430 --> 08:38.140
No matter what happens, go straight!

08:39.680 --> 08:40.770
Got it!

08:41.270 --> 08:44.190
<i>The Giants are so cool!</i>

08:44.310 --> 08:46.310
<i>Yeah, I like them too!</i>

08:47.360 --> 08:48.770
There it is. The Island Eater!

08:48.900 --> 08:50.940
We'll force you to clear the path.

08:50.980 --> 08:52.740
In the name of Elbaph!

09:11.380 --> 09:13.880
Hakoku Sovereignty!

09:15.680 --> 09:18.090
We're flying out!

09:19.220 --> 09:23.060
This is the power of the Elbaph warriors!

09:28.230 --> 09:30.860
Now, go!

09:32.730 --> 09:37.780
Guys! I swear I'll go to Elbaph someday!
To the village of warriors!

09:37.910 --> 09:39.240
Yeah! Okay!

09:39.700 --> 09:41.410
<i>By the way, Chobro,</i>

09:41.450 --> 09:47.420
<i>what led Dorry and Brogy
to a century-long duel?</i>

09:47.540 --> 09:49.250
<i>No idea...</i>

09:50.090 --> 09:52.920
<i>Anyway,
maybe because of their long lifespan,</i>

09:52.960 --> 09:56.630
<i>the Giants tend to be
laid-back and easygoing.</i>

09:58.470 --> 10:02.930
<i>For example, Oimo and Kashii
who were on Enies Lobby.</i>

10:04.390 --> 10:08.900
<i>They were originally
a part of the Giant Pirate Crew,</i>

10:08.940 --> 10:14.690
<i>but the World Government tricked them into
working as gatekeepers on the island.</i>

10:15.650 --> 10:17.530
How dare you?!

10:17.650 --> 10:20.160
<i>When they found out the truth,</i>

10:20.200 --> 10:22.160
<i>they rose up against the Government.</i>

10:22.280 --> 10:24.160
You deceived us!

10:27.870 --> 10:31.250
Join us, king of snipers!

10:33.210 --> 10:34.550
No problem!

10:34.590 --> 10:37.010
Signal the counterattack
this time for sure!

10:37.050 --> 10:39.380
Hurry to your comrades!

10:41.720 --> 10:44.760
In the end, Oimo and Kashii were freed

10:44.810 --> 10:47.730
and went back to Elbaph, their home.

10:47.850 --> 10:49.390
I see.

10:49.440 --> 10:51.940
Now, who is this in a mask?

10:52.810 --> 10:55.610
Oh, it changed again, Chobro.

10:55.650 --> 10:57.860
Is this man a Giant, too?

10:58.320 --> 10:59.280
Yeah.

10:59.740 --> 11:05.290
There is one Giant
who Robin can't ever forget.

11:05.660 --> 11:08.000
Can't forget?

11:30.770 --> 11:32.730
W... Wa...

11:35.190 --> 11:36.320
Worms?

11:54.540 --> 12:00.220
<i>The name of this big man who washed ashore
on the coast of Robin's home, Ohara...</i>

12:00.260 --> 12:01.300
<i>...was Saul.</i>

12:02.050 --> 12:03.340
I see...

12:15.060 --> 12:16.650
That's a weird way of laughing.

12:18.940 --> 12:21.150
My name is Saul.

12:21.610 --> 12:23.740
Jaguar D. Saul.

12:24.740 --> 12:25.740
"D"?

12:25.870 --> 12:28.120
When you're having a hard time,
just laugh.

12:28.580 --> 12:31.500
Now, you try, too.

12:32.000 --> 12:33.790
Do it like this.

12:41.590 --> 12:43.680
That's good! That's good!

12:51.020 --> 12:56.100
<i>Apparently, Robin's mother, an archaeologist,
traveled all over the world with her colleagues</i>

12:56.150 --> 13:00.440
<i>and studied the Ponegliffs
which was prohibited by the Government.</i>

13:01.360 --> 13:03.070
<i>But it was discovered,</i>

13:03.440 --> 13:06.360
<i>and a Buster Call was invoked
to destroy their island.</i>

13:07.780 --> 13:10.950
<i>The truth was that Saul used to be a Navy soldier.</i>

13:11.370 --> 13:14.000
<i>He doubted
the Government's way of doing things,</i>

13:14.040 --> 13:17.790
<i>and deserted,
taking Olvia, Robin's mother, with him.</i>

13:22.210 --> 13:25.590
Our research will end here,

13:25.630 --> 13:27.800
but even if Ohara perishes...

13:29.550 --> 13:34.430
...we cannot give up the future
you young ones will live in!

13:35.180 --> 13:37.190
<i>Saul, inheriting Olvia's will,</i>

13:37.770 --> 13:40.360
<i>decided to help the young Robin escape.</i>

13:40.480 --> 13:42.440
Mom!

13:43.440 --> 13:46.150
<i>From now on, for you and me both...</i>

13:46.280 --> 13:48.110
Live, Robin!

13:52.540 --> 13:55.370
<i>So this is a Buster Call...</i>

13:55.410 --> 13:57.500
<i>Go, Saul! Get away, Robin!</i>

14:00.590 --> 14:03.920
<i>This is an extremely
strong Navy soldier, Aokiji,</i>

14:03.960 --> 14:07.130
<i>who would later become
one of the Three Admirals of the Navy.</i>

14:07.260 --> 14:10.010
Ice Time Capsule!

14:14.060 --> 14:15.350
Saul! Are you okay?!

14:15.480 --> 14:17.690
Listen carefully, Robin!

14:18.440 --> 14:23.570
No one is born into this world to be alone!

14:26.530 --> 14:29.740
Run, Robin! Don't look back!

14:29.780 --> 14:33.830
When you're having a hard time,
laugh like this, just like I taught you!

14:35.830 --> 14:39.250
Go meet the friends
who're surely waiting for you...

14:39.290 --> 14:41.210
...somewhere at sea, Robin!

14:51.680 --> 14:57.980
So Robin owes her life to Saul,
who means the world to her.

14:58.100 --> 14:59.850
Just like...

14:59.890 --> 15:01.270
...carrots.

15:02.270 --> 15:03.940
You've ruined it!

15:07.400 --> 15:09.530
<i>Who is this mighty-looking Giant?</i>

15:10.280 --> 15:12.160
<i>If I remember right,</i>

15:12.200 --> 15:15.870
<i>he is Hajrudin
A.K.A. the Strongest Pirate Mercenary!</i>

15:16.830 --> 15:23.330
<i>He competed in a battle royale at Dressrosa,
where the Flame-Flame Fruit was on the line.</i>

15:23.880 --> 15:28.090
He is a warrior of the new generation
from the famous Giants' country, Elbaph!

15:28.800 --> 15:32.050
Hajrudin!

15:32.680 --> 15:35.680
<i>Seems like he-</i>teia<i> is from Elbaph, too.</i>

15:36.560 --> 15:38.770
I'm gonna become the king of...

15:39.930 --> 15:41.230
...all Giants!

15:42.520 --> 15:45.150
Take a good look, warriors!

15:45.520 --> 15:47.070
This man is...

15:47.570 --> 15:50.950
...the hero who broke the spell on us!

15:51.950 --> 15:53.490
His name is...

15:56.950 --> 16:01.080
Captain Usopp!

16:13.590 --> 16:16.600
God Usopp! God Usopp!

16:16.720 --> 16:18.350
<i>What's this?!</i>

16:18.470 --> 16:22.770
<i>I don't know what's going on here,
but this is so cool, Usopp!</i>

16:24.810 --> 16:29.440
<i>Those who met Luffy in Dressrosa
including Hajrudin drank out of the Sons' Cups...</i>

16:29.480 --> 16:33.280
<i>...to pledge their loyalty to Luffy
without his consent.</i>

16:33.400 --> 16:35.870
<i>Sons' Cups?!</i>

16:35.990 --> 16:37.240
We seven...

16:37.280 --> 16:41.620
...will drink out of these Sons' Cups
without your leave,

16:41.660 --> 16:44.080
devoting our lives and souls!

16:44.750 --> 16:48.710
<i>They're all quirky,
but they seem to be having fun!</i>

16:48.840 --> 16:52.170
<i>I want to raise a glass of carrot juice
with them, too!</i>

16:53.590 --> 16:57.260
<i>The Giants are so big, so strong,
and so cool!</i>

16:57.800 --> 17:00.810
<i>Please! Introduce more, Chobro!</i>

17:00.850 --> 17:02.600
<i>Who else is there?!</i>

17:02.730 --> 17:05.480
<i>Okay, then
let's go through them all quickly!</i>

17:09.190 --> 17:12.860
<i>Morley, the Captain of
the Revolutionary Army Western Forces!</i>

17:13.650 --> 17:18.160
<i>Sanjuan Wolf, A.K.A. the Giant Battleship,
is also a Giant.</i>

17:18.280 --> 17:19.700
<i>He's massive!</i>

17:19.830 --> 17:21.540
They found me!

17:22.870 --> 17:24.620
<i>On Sabaody Archipelago,</i>

17:24.660 --> 17:29.630
<i>there was a guy named Stansen
who was put up for a human auction.</i>

17:30.920 --> 17:34.260
<i>Even the Navy uses
the power of the Giants.</i>

17:35.170 --> 17:37.800
<i>Vice Admiral John Giant.</i>

17:40.100 --> 17:44.180
<i>Lonz and Lacroix
are part of the Giant Team.</i>

17:46.520 --> 17:48.150
<i>Say, Chobro,</i>

17:48.190 --> 17:51.190
<i>is he-</i>teia<i> also a Giant?</i>

17:52.730 --> 17:56.650
<i>If I'm correct, he is Littleoars Jr.</i>

17:58.200 --> 18:02.620
<i>He is a descendant of Oars the Continent Puller,</i>

18:02.660 --> 18:04.910
<i>who we saw on Thriller Bark.</i>

18:06.710 --> 18:11.630
<i>He is much bigger than the Giants
and has horns.</i>

18:12.170 --> 18:15.630
<i>I don't know whether he is a Giant or not.</i>

18:15.760 --> 18:18.550
<i>So there are unknown giant people, too.</i>

18:18.590 --> 18:21.390
<i>The sea is a wonderland!</i>

18:22.350 --> 18:26.270
<i>Oh yeah, there were mysterious giant people
in the Land of Wano too!</i>

18:31.110 --> 18:32.110
<i>I remember now!</i>

18:33.150 --> 18:38.030
<i>It seems Big Mom was trying
to secure the power of the Giants...</i>

18:38.070 --> 18:40.320
<i>...through a political marriage.</i>

18:40.700 --> 18:42.580
<i>Nami and I heard about this together!</i>

18:43.950 --> 18:45.700
<i>But the plan failed.</i>

18:46.660 --> 18:51.750
<i>That's why she became obsessed
with research to turn people into giants.</i>

18:51.880 --> 18:56.880
<i>That tells you how captivating the Giants are
in this world of the sea.</i>

18:57.630 --> 18:59.220
Could you help us?

18:59.680 --> 19:01.430
Dorry. Brogy.

19:03.180 --> 19:05.260
No problem, bro!

19:06.850 --> 19:08.480
Are you gonna fight them, Red-Haired?!

19:13.110 --> 19:14.900
Hey, small humans!

19:14.940 --> 19:18.070
If you point a gun
at someone else's hometown...

19:20.740 --> 19:24.240
Be prepared to be attacked yourself!

19:25.200 --> 19:26.740
Hakoku Sovereignty!

19:49.390 --> 19:52.850
Actually, right now,
the Giant Pirate Crew...

19:52.900 --> 19:56.770
...came to Egghead to help us!

19:56.900 --> 20:00.150
Dorry and Brogy are on the island
where Luffy and you all are now?!

20:00.190 --> 20:02.030
Why?!

20:03.860 --> 20:06.280
Keep breaking them down, Chobro!

20:06.410 --> 20:08.830
You just wanna eat carrots!

20:14.130 --> 20:18.670
That's it, Chobro!
That's the huge shadow that I saw before!

20:18.710 --> 20:21.340
It must be one of the Giants!

20:21.470 --> 20:24.590
Yeah, it is big, but...

20:26.100 --> 20:29.060
I am not a Giant! It is me!

20:30.560 --> 20:34.190
There you are, Chopperemon, Carrot!

20:34.310 --> 20:37.150
Momonosuke and Yamato?!

20:37.270 --> 20:39.110
Why are you here?!

20:39.570 --> 20:42.820
When I heard you guys
were on a nearby island,

20:42.860 --> 20:45.570
I just couldn't stay away!

20:45.610 --> 20:49.160
So I asked Momonosuke-<i>kun</i> to come with me
and we flew here!

20:49.290 --> 20:51.870
We looked for you everywhere
and I am so exhau...

20:51.910 --> 20:54.170
I mean, excited!

20:54.290 --> 20:57.500
We had trouble finding them
and you were crying, weren't you?

20:57.630 --> 20:59.550
I-I did not cry!

20:59.670 --> 21:06.090
Well then, the enormous shadow
that Carrot saw was not a Giant...

21:06.140 --> 21:08.760
It was Momonosuke in his dragon form!

21:08.890 --> 21:11.850
Gee, you scared me!

21:11.890 --> 21:14.600
I dropped a carrot because of it!

21:14.640 --> 21:16.310
As a punishment, here is...

21:16.350 --> 21:17.860
Garchu!

21:18.520 --> 21:21.110
Ouch! You are hurting me!

21:22.030 --> 21:23.690
What's the matter, Carrot?

21:33.330 --> 21:37.420
<i>Piipapii papipo, piipapii papipo
Piipapii papipo, piipapii</i>

21:37.540 --> 21:41.710
<i>Piipapii papipo, piipapii papipo
Piipii pipopii, pipopiipii</i>

21:41.750 --> 21:45.760
<i>Piipapii papipo, piipapii papipo
Piipapii papipo, piipapii</i>

21:45.930 --> 21:47.970
<i>Piipapii papipo, piipapii</i>

21:50.140 --> 21:53.560
<i>No No No No No norenai</i>

21:50.140 --> 21:53.560
<i>No, no, no, no, no, this ain't a groove</i>

21:53.600 --> 21:57.480
<i>kobiritsuichatte mou odorenai</i>

21:53.600 --> 21:57.480
<i>All stuck in place, can't even dance or move</i>

21:57.810 --> 22:02.020
<i>atama Feel so good,
mata Unlucky demo</i>

21:57.810 --> 22:02.020
<i>Feeling so good in the head
Though down on our luck again</i>

22:02.070 --> 22:05.820
<i>cora de fukitobase yowaki wo</i>

22:02.070 --> 22:05.820
<i>Throw down some cola
And just blast right past those fears</i>

22:06.150 --> 22:10.280
<i>soko no Boys & Girls! omae ii yatsu</i>

22:06.150 --> 22:10.280
<i>Hey, you boys & girls! Y'all are alright</i>

22:10.320 --> 22:13.160
<i>soko no Boys & Girls!</i>

22:10.320 --> 22:13.160
<i>Hey, you boys & girls!</i>

22:15.580 --> 22:17.670
<i>appudeto wa shippai kori gori</i>

22:15.580 --> 22:17.670
<i>Failed to make some updates
Had enough of it</i>

22:17.710 --> 22:19.630
